  "rationale": "The English cue and both Malay answers are semantically accurate. However, “buku teks” is also a valid Indonesian term, while “buku pelajaran” is understandable and attested in Malaysian Malay. The relation “different-common-word” therefore overstates the dialect contrast; this is better treated as a preference or usage-pattern contrast. No false-friend issue is present.",
